## The two things that are NOT fully automated (the gaps)

**Gap 1 — The manifest is not reconciled at sandbox start.** The `.kvist/vendoring-v1.json` (the *enforcement* record, used by `kvist`'s own `run_offline_cargo_verification` and any `kvist test`/`kvist verify`) was written on **Sep 25 / Oct 4** against an old `Cargo.lock` digest (`c18791bb…`). The current `Cargo.lock` digest is `d281cfde…` (it changed on Oct 6 when `csscolorparser` was added in `dda71a3`, plus earlier). So `assert_ready` **would fail-closed with `VendoringStale`** even though the vendored *material* is present (the dev sandbox builds fine because the dev `cargo` wrapper bypasses the manifest entirely and points straight at `/rust/vendor`).

