The **project-local `.cargo/config.toml` is hand-managed and gitignored**, which is how the stale `/opt/proj/kvist` path sneaked in. Per ADR‑0011 the authoritative offline config is the *sandbox* one (`.kvist/sandbox-cargo/config.toml`, mounted at `/workspace/.cargo`), and Kvist deliberately does **not** write the project-local one. I'd recommend either (a) deleting the local one in this environment so the wrapper/mirror is the single source of truth, or (b) documenting that it must point at the real `.kvist/vendored`. Right now it's a latent foot-gun that breaks `clippy` before the gate even runs.

