## What changed

**`05c05cf` — `feat(engine): provision Rust deps in a network-allow acquisition sandbox`** (9 files, +1095/−30)

This implements the model you asked for: provisioning happens **inside the sandbox, before the effect sandbox executes** — not on the bare host.

| Step | Where | Network |
|---|---|---|
| `cargo fetch` (the only network step) | **Dependency-acquisition sandbox** — network-allow, allowlisted crates.io + project-approved sources | **Allow** (typed sources) |
| `cargo vendor --offline` (repack fetched material → `.kvist/vendored`) | Host, **offline** | **None** |
| `cargo test --locked` / `cargo build` | **Effect sandbox** | **None** (denied + vendored registry) |

